    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_AirShip:Tutorial_AirShip_002:1d1a9f8d",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_AirShip",
        "key": "Tutorial_AirShip_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_AirShip:Tutorial_AirShip_002:1d1a9f8d",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_AirShip:Tutorial_AirShip_002:1d1a9f8d",
        "jp_sha256": "4d34eac5f325ce08bd3217d3113c199b5d00e9af59603bf52069488a4a66e112",
        "official_en_sha256": "4ab04ce28ccb9fabbe781ccd581fb0d6377cb3c4650c2cc0d32a0aa8e3d2ac58"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "飛空艇を手に入れました。\r\n飛空艇に乗ることで、世界中を飛び回ることができます！\r\n\r\n各地を巡り、まだ見ぬ光の祠やサブクエストを探してみましょう。\r\nサブクエストを通じて生まれた絆によっては、\r\n新たなビジョンが手に入ることがあるかも……？\r\n\r\nまた、グランシェルトではコロシアムが開催しているようです！\r\n一度訪れた場所でも、新たな発見があるかもしれません。",
        "official_en": "With your new airship, the entire world is now within\r\nyour reach!\r\n\r\nSoar across the skies in search of more Sanctums of\r\nLight, or uncover additional side quests to\r\nstrengthen bonds that may grant you powerful new\r\nvisions.\r\n\r\nWho knows—previously explored locations may even\r\nhold new surprises.\r\n\r\nAnd don’t forget: the Colosseum in Grandshelt is\r\nhome to fierce fights! Why not test your mettle there?",
        "real_en": "You’ve obtained an airship! Now you can fly all over the world.\r\n\r\nVisit different places to find Sanctums of Light and side quests you haven’t discovered yet. The bonds formed through side quests might even lead you to new visions...\r\n\r\nThere’s also a Colosseum in Grandshelt! Even places you’ve visited before may hold new discoveries."
      },
